From f7dca9519f4cce214b6fa016e9b99223be7abb53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rasheed <99349713+gitRasheed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:10:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 49/61] docs: NNS.stack and NNS.boost defaults and CV
 description

Roxygen (R/Stack.R, R/Boost.R) and Rd:
- NNS.stack dim.red.method: the default is "cor" (usage and code), not
  "NNS.dep", and "cor" is Spearman rank correlation.
- NNS.stack CV.size: NULL means (stratified) k-fold CV for folds > 1; the
  random 0.2-0.33 holdout applies only with folds = 1; a numeric CV.size
  gives one random holdout per fold.
- Remove the stale note about "object 'RP' not found" (that code no
  longer exists).
- NNS.boost objective: the default is "min", not "max".
Documentation only.
---
 R/Boost.R        |  2 +-
 R/Stack.R        | 11 ++---------
 man/NNS.boost.Rd |  2 +-
 man/NNS.stack.Rd | 10 ++--------
 4 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

diff --git a/R/Boost.R b/R/Boost.R
index 39f7ecd..fe0d8fb 100644
